  "description": "This library provides DOC (Direct Online Communication) mode communication with Micro-Sensys RFID readers. \nUsing the functions implemented is possible to search for a transponder (Identify), read data from transponder memory (ReadBytes), write data to a transponder memory (WriteBytes) or get measurements from TELID® transponder sensors.\nIt is possible to call blocking functions, async functions and run the functions in separate threads.\n\nUsed Type:\niIDReaderLibrary.DocInterfaceControl",
